{"seq":2,"slug":"early-ventures","title":"创业起步","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/elon-musk/life-and-times/early-ventures","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"zip2-and-paypal","title":"Zip2 与 PayPal","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/elon-musk/life-and-times/early-ventures/zip2-and-paypal","wordCount":1746,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-leap-to-space-and-cars","title":"转向航天与汽车","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/elon-musk/life-and-times/early-ventures/the-leap-to-space-and-cars","wordCount":1534,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"创业起步\">创业起步</h1><p>本章是传记主线的第二段（1995—2008），回答「互联网时代赚到的钱，如何变成转向硬科技的燃料」。它串起两次成功退出与一次几乎倾家荡产的豪赌，揭示马斯克「赚到即押注更大目标」的资本循环。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>第一篇 <a href=\"zip2-and-paypal\">Zip2 与 PayPal</a>：康柏 3.07 亿、eBay 15 亿两次套现的金额、教训与资本去向。</li>\n<li>第二篇 <a href=\"the-leap-to-space-and-cars\">转向航天与汽车</a>：把 PayPal 所得悉数押注 SpaceX 与特斯拉，并在 2008 年险些破产。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>承上启下：本章的「跨学科认知」前置见上一章 <a href=\"../early-life-and-education/\">早年与教育</a>；2008 绝境逢生后的崛起见下一章 <a href=\"../building-an-empire/\">商业帝国</a>；各公司的工程成就见 <a href=\"../../core-contributions/\">核心贡献</a>。</p>\n"}